## Tests

**`crates/cards/tests/cross/hand_returns.rs`**: change `use super::{fixture, scenario};` to `use super::{craft_fused, fixture, scenario};`. Add a module `r3800000_a_fused_spell_returns_on_its_spell_texts_end_of_turn_alone`:
