2. Exile it: `sink_events(&mut state, &mut ev, |sink| run(sink, &index, vec![effects::exile(json_as(json!({ "target": { "of": "self" } })))]))`.
3. Assert `card(&state, &index.id).zone == Zone::Exile { player: P1 }`.
