**`crates/engine/tests/rules/effects_tune.rs`**: in module `classic_plus_41_kys_constant_a_number_set_outright_r386`, add **`r3800002_a_cost_set_on_a_card_in_a_graveyard_or_an_exile_pile_changes_nothing`**. For each of `Zone::Graveyard { player: P1 }` and `Zone::Exile { player: P1 }`:
